#import "@tola/source:0.0.0": tola-meta

#tola-meta((
  title: "Hello, World",
  date: "2024-11-02",
  summary: "A short first post. Replace it with your own.",
  tags: ("example",),
))

The home page lists the ten newest posts. The archive groups every post by
year, with a posts-per-month density chart; the tags page counts posts per
tag. Both number posts with the document prefix from `templates/config.typ`.

CJK text works too: 中文段落使用系统字体或更纱黑体显示，阅读时间按字数估算。
